#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:484
msgid "Reset all settings"
msgstr "Nulstil alle indstillinger"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:486
msgid "Puts every setting back to default. Games, folders and saves are kept."
msgstr "Alle indstillinger tilbage, som Porpoise leveres. Spil, mapper og gemte data bliver."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:516 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1725
msgid "Which emulator plays this system's games, from the next game. Each keeps its own settings and saves."
msgstr "Hvilken emulator der spiller denne sides spil, fra det næste, der startes. Hver beholder sine egne indstillinger og gemte data."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:520
msgid "Games folder"
msgstr "Spilmappe"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:520
msgid "Where this system's games are. Changing it doesn't move any games or saves."
msgstr "Mappen, som denne sides spil ligger i. At vælge en anden flytter intet: spil og gemte data bliver, hvor de er."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:521 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1072
msgid "Look for games now"
msgstr "Led efter spil nu"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:526 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1733
msgid "Open emulator settings and saves"
msgstr "Åbn emulatorens indstillinger og gemte data"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:527 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1734
msgid "Opens this emulator's own menus for its settings, controls and saves. Quit them to come back here."
msgstr "Denne sides emulator har sine egne indstillinger, sin egen styring og sine gemte data: dette åbner dens menuer, så du kan ændre dem, og at afslutte dem fører tilbage hertil. Det, den allerede havde, bliver, hvor det er."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:530
msgid "Porpoise's other settings, your button layouts and Wii Remote setup. Circle at the top comes back here."
msgstr "Porpoises andre indstillinger, dine knaplayouts og Wii Remotens opsætning, i dens egne menuer. Cirkel øverst i dem fører hertil igen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:533 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1283 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1956
msgid "Back up to USB"
msgstr "Sikkerhedskopiér til USB"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:533
msgid "Every system's saves. A save state only loads in the emulator that made it."
msgstr "Hver sides gemte data, hver emulators. En gemt tilstand indlæses kun i den emulator, der lavede den."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:534 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2847
msgid "Emulator diagnostics"
msgstr "Emulatordiagnosticering"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:610
msgid "Still starting. One moment."
msgstr "Cemu starter stadig. Et øjeblik."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:610
msgid "The Wii U emulator did not start, so this can't be changed."
msgstr "Cemu startede ikke, så dette kan ikke ændres."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:621
msgid "The menu language, and game names where available."
msgstr "Menuernes sprog, og spillenes navne, hvor spillet har et på sproget."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:622
msgid "Playtendoh uses the PS5's language unless you choose another. Game names follow it where the game has one in that language, otherwise they are in English. Descriptions from GameTDB are in English."
msgstr "Playtendoh taler PS5’ens sprog, medmindre du vælger et andet her; opsætningstjekket ved første start giver det samme valg. Et spils navn følger det, hvor spillet har et navn på sproget, som på en konsol indstillet til det; ellers er det det engelske. Beskrivelser kommer fra GameTDB på engelsk og grafikpakker fra deres forfattere, som de skrev dem."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:626 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:724
msgid "How the picture is scaled to the TV."
msgstr "Hvordan billedet skaleres til tv’et."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:627
msgid "Bicubic is sharp, Bicubic Hermite a little softer, Bilinear softest. Nearest neighbour keeps pixels square. AMD FSR 1 keeps edges clean for games below 4K, at a small GPU cost."
msgstr "Bikubisk er skarp, Bikubisk Hermite lidt blødere, Bilineær endnu blødere; Nærmeste nabo holder pixels firkantede. AMD FSR 1 holder kanterne rene i et spil, der tegnes under 4K, for lidt mere arbejde til GPU'en end Bikubisk."

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the frame rate's settings (120 Hz output, frame pacing, frame generation)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:636
msgid "Frame rate"
msgstr "Billedhastighed"

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the frame rate's settings (120 Hz output, frame pacing, frame generation)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:636
msgid "120 Hz output, frame pacing and frame generation."
msgstr "120 Hz-output, jævn billedrytme og billedgenerering."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:637
msgid "Refresh rate, frame pacing and frame generation. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "Skærmens opdateringshastighed, et spil holdt på en jævn billedhastighed og et billede lavet mellem hver to billeder. Trekant på hver linje fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:638
msgid "120 Hz output"
msgstr "120 Hz-output"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:638
msgid "For displays that take 120 Hz."
msgstr "Til skærme, der kan tage 120 Hz."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:639
msgid "Uses 120 Hz on displays that support it. Games run at normal speed, and late frames wait less."
msgstr "119,88 Hz-tilstanden, på skærme der understøtter den. Spil kører stadig i deres egen hastighed, og et billede, der misser en opdatering, venter 8 ms på den næste i stedet for 17."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:644
msgid "Holds a game to an even frame rate."
msgstr "Holder et spil på en jævn billedhastighed."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:645
msgid "Keeps each frame on screen for the same time, so a game that can't hold full speed runs evenly: 60 or 40 fps with 120 Hz output, 30 or 20 without. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Hvert billede bliver på skærmen i mindst to eller tre opdateringer, så et spil, der ikke kan holde skærmens takt, kører jævnt: 60 eller 40 fps med 120 Hz-output, 30 eller 20 uden. 60 fps med 120 Hz-output passer til et spil i 4K, der nogle gange falder under 60; 30 fps ved 60 Hz til et i 8K. Også i spilmenuen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:648 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:705 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:777
msgid "Shows 30 fps games at 60."
msgstr "Et spil låst til 30 fps vist med 60."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:649 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:706
msgid "Adds a frame between each pair, so a 30 fps game shows at 60 (or 60 at 120 with 120 Hz output). Adds a little delay. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "MihawkGen laver et billede mellem hver to billeder i et spil, der tager to opdateringer eller flere pr. billede, så et spil på 30 fps vises med 60, eller med 60 ved 120 Hz-output. Et hurtigere spil vises, som det er. Det koster GPU'en cirka 2 ms pr. billede i 4K og tilføjer en lille forsinkelse. Også i spilmenuen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:653
msgid "Your ReShade preset and effects, from {0}."
msgstr "Din ReShade-forudindstilling og dine effekter fra {0}."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:654
msgid "Runs a ReShade preset made on a PC over the game. Put ReShadePreset.ini (or presets/<title ID>.ini for one game) and its Shaders and Textures folders in {0}. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Lægger en ReShade-forudindstilling lavet på en pc over spillets billede, før GamePad-skærmen og menuerne. Læg ReShadePreset.ini (eller presets/<titel-ID>.ini til ét spil) med de mapper Shaders og Textures, den bruger, i {0}. Kompileres, når spillet starter; opstartsloggen siger, hvad der kører. Også i spilmenuen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:657
msgid "Frame rate, CPU and memory in a corner."
msgstr "Billedhastighed, CPU og hukommelse i et hjørne."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:658
msgid "Shows frame rate, CPU and memory use in the top-left corner. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Billeder pr. sekund, CPU- og hukommelsesforbrug i øverste venstre hjørne, som Cemu viser dem. Også i spilmenuen."

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the shaders' settings
#. Settings > Graphics' Shaders row, its value: where the 3DS's vertex shaders run, on the GPU (Hardware) or on the CPU (Software)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:661 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:690
msgid "Shaders"
msgstr "Shadere"

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the shaders' settings
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:661
msgid "How new shaders are built, and shader notices."
msgstr "Hvordan nye shadere bygges, og Cemus beskeder om dem."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:662
msgid "Async shader compile and shader notices. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "Asynkron shaderkompilering og de beskeder, Cemu viser, mens et spil bygger sine shadere. Trekant på hver linje fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:663 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:701 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1022
msgid "No stutter while new shaders build."
msgstr "Ingen hakken, mens nye shaders bygges."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:664 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:702 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1023
msgid "On: shaders build in the background, so less stutter, but some things may appear late. Off: the game waits for each shader, which stutters but draws everything right."
msgstr "Til: en ny shader bygges, mens spillet kører videre, så det hakker ikke, men noget kan mangle et øjeblik. Fra: spillet venter på hver shader. Hakken, men intet tegnes forkert."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:666
msgid "Shows a notice while shaders build."
msgstr "Cemus »kompilerede shadere«-beskeder over et spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:667
msgid "A notice in the corner while a game builds shaders. Off hides it; shaders are built either way. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Beskederne, Cemu viser i et hjørne, mens et spil bygger sine shadere og pipelines (»Loaded 1200 shaders«). Fra skjuler dem; shaderne bygges alligevel. Også i spilmenuen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:672 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:716
msgid "Higher is sharper but needs more power."
msgstr "Højere er skarpere og kræver mere af GPU’en."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:673
msgid "How large 3D scenes are drawn before scaling to the TV. Higher is sharper but needs more power, and some games slow down more."
msgstr "Hvor store 3DS’ens 3D-scener tegnes, før de skaleres til tv’et. Højere er skarpere og kræver mere af GPU’en, og hver gang et spil læser et billede tilbage, vokser ventetiden med."

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the textures' settings (the texture filter, custom textures)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:680
msgid "Textures"
msgstr "Teksturer"

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the textures' settings (the texture filter, custom textures)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:680
msgid "The texture filter, and texture packs."
msgstr "Teksturfilteret og teksturpakker."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:681
msgid "Texture filter and your own texture packs. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "Et filter, der udglatter spillets teksturer, når de forstørres, og dine egne teksturpakker. Trekant på hver linje fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:682
msgid "Smooths textures as they are scaled up."
msgstr "Udglatter teksturer, når de skaleres op."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:683
msgid "Smooths textures as they are scaled up. None keeps them as the 3DS draws them. At high resolutions this is the heaviest setting: if a game stutters, try None first."
msgstr "Udglatter spillets teksturer, når de skaleres op; Ingen lader dem være, som 3DS’en tegner dem. Et filter gentegner hver tekstur i den interne opløsning: ved høje opløsninger er det den tungeste indstilling. Hvis et spil hakker, så prøv Ingen først."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:685
msgid "Texture packs from azahar/load/textures."
msgstr "Teksturpakker fra azahar/load/textures."

#. {0} is the app's data folder: /data/ps5cemu, or the PS5CEMU-HAR-data folder on the drive the app is installed on
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:687
msgid "Texture packs in {0}/azahar/load/textures/<title ID>."
msgstr "Teksturpakker i {0}/azahar/load/textures/<titel-id>, som computerversionen af Azahar indlæser dem."

#. Settings > Graphics' Shaders row, its value: where the 3DS's vertex shaders run, on the GPU (Hardware) or on the CPU (Software)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:690
msgctxt "shaders"
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "Hardware"

#. Settings > Graphics' Shaders row, its value: where the 3DS's vertex shaders run, on the GPU (Hardware) or on the CPU (Software)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:690
msgctxt "shaders"
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Software"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:691
msgid "Where the 3DS's shaders run, and how new ones are built."
msgstr "Hvor 3DS’ens shadere kører, og hvordan nye bygges."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:692
msgid "Hardware shaders, outline fix and async shader compile. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "Hardware-shadere, konturrettelsen til dem og asynkron shaderkompilering. Trekant på hver linje fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:693
msgid "Hardware shaders"
msgstr "Hardware-shadere"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:693
msgid "Off draws 3D exactly on the CPU. Off for Pokémon by default."
msgstr "Fra: 3D tegnet præcist på CPU’en. Fra for Pokémon."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:694
msgid "On runs 3D on the PS5's GPU, the fastest way. Off runs it on the CPU: slower, but outlines and lighting are exact. Off by default for the 3DS Pokémon games, whose outlines, lighting and shadows glitch otherwise. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Til kører 3DS’ens vertex-shadere på PS5’ens GPU, den hurtigste måde. Fra kører de på CPU’en som Azahars software-shadere: langsommere, men en model og konturen, der tegnes omkring den, beregnes ens, og dens lys rettes pr. trekant. Fra som standard for Pokémon X, Y, Omega Ruby, Alpha Sapphire, Sun, Moon, Ultra Sun og Ultra Moon, hvis konturer, lys og skygger ellers fejler. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:696
msgid "Outline fix"
msgstr "Konturrettelse"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:696
msgid "Fixes moving black dots on outlined 3D models."
msgstr "Retter bevægelige sorte prikker på 3D-modeller med kontur."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:697
msgid "Fixes moving black dots on outlined 3D models with hardware shaders on. For the Pokémon games, turn Hardware shaders off instead. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Beregner hver 3D-position ens begge gange, som Azahar gør på Apples GPU’er. Til et spil, der viser bevægelige sorte prikker på sine modeller med konturer, når hardware-shadere er slået til; Pokémon-spillene tegnes i stedet rigtigt med Hardware-shadere slået fra. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:708
msgid "3D for red and cyan glasses"
msgstr "3D til rød-cyan briller"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:708
msgid "The 3DS's 3D, in red and cyan."
msgstr "3DS'ens 3D i rød og cyan."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:709
msgid "Shows the 3DS's 3D for red and cyan glasses, with the 3D slider all the way up. Colours change with it. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "3DS'ens 3D-skærm som begge øjnes billeder i ét, rød for venstre og cyan for højre, så du ser 3D med rød-cyan briller, som Azahars anaglyf-tilstand laver det, med 3D-skyderen helt oppe. Farverne ændrer sig med det. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:717
msgid "How large Lichii draws a game before scaling it to the TV. Higher values are sharper and use more graphics memory."
msgstr "Hvor stor Lichii tegner spillet, før det skaleres til tv'et. Højere værdier er skarpere og bruger mere grafik-hukommelse."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:718
msgid "How large games are drawn before scaling to the TV. 1x is 1080p docked and 720p handheld. Higher is sharper but needs more power and graphics memory. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Hvor stort Eden tegner et spil, før det skaleres til tv'et, i forhold til spillets eget billede: 1x er 1080p i docken og 720p håndholdt. Højere er skarpere og kræver mere af GPU'en; 3x og 4x skal have grafikhukommelsen til det. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:725
msgid "Choose Bilinear, AMD FSR 1, Bicubic or Nearest neighbour. Applies when the next game starts."
msgstr "Vælg Bilineær, AMD FSR 1, Bikubisk eller Nærmeste nabo. Gælder, når næste spil starter."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:726
msgid "Bilinear is soft, Bicubic sharper, Nearest neighbour keeps pixels square. AMD FSR 1 keeps edges clean for games below 4K, at a small GPU cost."
msgstr "Bilineær er blød, Bikubisk skarpere; Nærmeste nabo holder pixels firkantede. AMD FSR 1 holder kanterne rene i et spil, der tegnes under 4K, for lidt mere arbejde til GPU'en."

#. Settings > Graphics on the Switch side: a row that opens FSR sharpening, anti-aliasing and Eden's ReShade looks
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:734
msgid "Picture effects"
msgstr "Billedeffekter"

#. Settings > Graphics on the Switch side: a row that opens FSR sharpening, anti-aliasing and Eden's ReShade looks
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:734
msgid "Sharpening, anti-aliasing and ReShade."
msgstr "Skarphed, kantudjævning og ReShade-looks."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:735
msgid "FSR sharpening, anti-aliasing and ReShade looks (built-in or your own). Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "FSR-skarphed, mens AMD FSR 1 skalerer billedet; Edens kantudjævning; og et ReShade-look over billedet, Edens eget eller et af dine. Trekant på hver linje fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:743
msgid "How much AMD FSR 1 sharpens the picture."
msgstr "Hvor meget AMD FSR 1 gør billedet skarpere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:744
msgid "How much AMD FSR 1 sharpens the picture. 100% is the most; each step down halves it. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Hvor meget AMD FSR 1 gør billedet skarpere, mens det skaleres til tv’et: 100 % er mest, og hvert trin ned halverer det. Også i spilmenuen, hvor det ændres med det samme."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:747
msgid "Smooths the jagged edges of the picture."
msgstr "Udjævner billedets takkede kanter."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:748
msgid "FXAA smooths edges lightly, SMAA more cleanly, each at a small GPU cost. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Edens kantudjævning, over spillets billede: FXAA udjævner kanter let, SMAA renere, hver for lidt mere arbejde til GPU’en. Fra, som Eden har det. Også i spilmenuen, hvor det ændres med det samme."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:752
msgid "ASTC textures"
msgstr "ASTC-teksturer"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:752
msgid "Compressed"
msgstr "Komprimerede"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:752
msgid "Full quality"
msgstr "Fuld kvalitet"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:753
msgid "Compressed saves graphics memory; full quality looks best."
msgstr "Komprimerede sparer grafikhukommelse; fuld kvalitet ser bedst ud."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:754
msgid "Many Switch games use ASTC textures, which must be converted for the PS5. Compressed saves memory; Full quality uses four times as much, for games whose textures look blocky. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Mange Switch-spil gemmer deres teksturer i ASTC, som PS5'ens GPU ikke kan læse: Eden konverterer dem. Komprimerede holder dem små, som BC3; fuld kvalitet beholder dem, som de er, med fire gange grafikhukommelsen, til et spil, hvis teksturer ser kantede ud. Gælder fra næste spil."

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the output resolution, refresh rate and frame generation
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:764
msgid "Output to the TV"
msgstr "Output til tv’et"

#. Settings > Graphics: a row that opens the output resolution, refresh rate and frame generation
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:764
msgid "Output size, 120 Hz and frame generation."
msgstr "Billedets størrelse, 120 Hz og billedgenerering."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:765
msgid "Output size, refresh rate and frame generation. Each applies to the next game."
msgstr "Outputstørrelse, opdateringsfrekvens og billedgenerering for Lichii; hver indstilling gælder fra næste spilstart."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:766
msgid "Output size, 120 Hz and frame generation. Each applies to the next game."
msgstr "Størrelsen på billedet, Eden sender til tv’et, om det sendes i 120 Hz, og ProsperoEdens billedgenerering. Hver gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:768 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:769 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:770 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:771
msgid "The resolution sent to the TV. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Størrelsen på det billede, Eden sender til tv'et. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:773
msgid "120 Hz"
msgstr "120 Hz"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:773 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:774
msgid "For TVs that support 120 Hz. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Til et tv, der tager imod 120 Hz. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:778
msgid "Frame generation, where supported. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Lichii's billedgenerering, hvis denne version og grafikbackend understøtter det. Gælder fra næste spilstart."

#. {0} is where Lossless.dll goes: /data/eden/user/lossless/Lossless.dll, or the same on the app's drive
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:780
msgid "Adds a frame between each pair, so a 30 fps game shows at 60. Uses Lossless Scaling if your own Lossless.dll is at {0}. Adds a little delay. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "ProsperoEdens egen billedgenerering: et billede lavet mellem hver to billeder, så et spil på 30 fps vises med 60. Den er Lossless Scalings, når din egen kopi af dens Lossless.dll ligger på {0}, ellers MihawkGens. Det kræver mere af GPU'en og giver en lille forsinkelse. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:789
msgid "How the DS's screens are scaled."
msgstr "Hvordan DS'ens skærme skaleres."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:790
msgid "Sharp keeps pixels crisp and even at any size. Smooth blends them. Square pixels can look uneven at some sizes. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Hvordan DS'ens skærme på 256 x 192 skaleres til tv'et. Skarp holder hver pixel firkantet og ens i alle størrelser; Blød lader dem flyde sammen; Firkantede pixels tager den nærmeste, ujævnt hvor størrelsen ikke er et helt tal. Spilmenuen ændrer det også."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:794
msgid "Recompiler"
msgstr "Omkompilator"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:795
msgid "Much faster than the interpreter."
msgstr "melonDS' JIT: meget hurtigere end dens fortolker."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:795
msgid "Not available: games run in the slower mode."
msgstr "Ingen eksekverbar hukommelse: den langsommere fortolker kører."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:796
msgid "Runs games much faster, when the PS5 allows it (Diagnostics shows whether it does). Turn it off for a game that runs wrong. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Kører DS'ens to processorer på melonDS' omkompilator, i den eksekverbare hukommelse PS5'en giver (Diagnosticering viser, om den gør), langt hurtigere end dens fortolker. Fra: fortolkeren, langsommere, til et spil, omkompilatoren kører forkert. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:803
msgid "Screen layout"
msgstr "Skærmlayout"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:803
msgid "How the two screens fit on the TV."
msgstr "Hvordan de to skærme deler tv’et."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:804
msgid "Stacked, top only, large top with small bottom, or side by side. In a game, touchpad click + R1 changes it."
msgstr "Den ene over den anden, kun den øverste, den øverste stor med den nederste ved siden af, eller begge side om side. I et spil går klik på touchpladen + R1 til det næste."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:808
msgid "For games held sideways, like a book."
msgstr "Til spil, man holder på siden som en bog."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:809
msgid "Turns both screens a quarter turn at a time, for games played with the DS held sideways. The touchpad follows the turned screen. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Drejer DS'ens to skærme sammen, en kvart omgang ad gangen, til spil, hvor man holder DS'en på siden som en bog (Hotel Dusk). Touchpladen flytter markøren over den nederste skærm, som tv'et viser den. Spilmenuen ændrer det også."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:810
msgid "Turns both screens a quarter turn at a time, for games played with the 3DS held sideways. The touchpad follows the turned screen. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Drejer 3DS'ens to skærme sammen, en kvart omgang ad gangen, til spil, hvor man holder 3DS'en på siden som en bog. Touchpladen flytter markøren over den nederste skærm, som tv'et viser den. Spilmenuen ændrer det også."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:813
msgid "A gap between the screens, like the hinge."
msgstr "De to skærme holdt fra hinanden, som hængslet holder dem."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:814
msgid "Adds a gap between the two screens in any layout. Can be set per game, and in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Et mellemrum mellem de to skærme, hvor begge vises: den ene over den anden, side om side eller drejet som en bog. Et spil kan have sin egen; spilmenuens hurtighandlinger ændrer det også."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:818
msgid "Touch the bottom screen while only the top one shows."
msgstr "Touchpladen berører den, mens kun den øverste skærm vises."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:819
msgid "With only the top screen shown, the touchpad still touches the bottom screen, with a cursor on the top one. For games that ask for a touch now and then. Can be set per game, and in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Med kun den øverste skærm på tv'et berører touchpladen alligevel den nederste skærm: markøren bevæger sig over den øverste, som om den nederste var der, til spil, der af og til beder om en berøring (Star Fox 64 3D). Fra berører touchpladen kun en nederste skærm, der vises. Et spil kan have sin egen; spilmenuen ændrer det også."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:821
msgid "Artwork around the screens."
msgstr "Grafik rundt om skærmene."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:822
msgid "Artwork around the screens, in every layout. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Grafik omkring skærmene, aldrig oven på dem. Den følger hvert layout, og spilmenuen ændrer den også."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:832
msgid "Adjusts where touchpad touches land, for games where they're off. 0% and 100% leave it unchanged. Doesn't affect the remote touch screen. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Flytter og skalerer, hvor touchpladens markør rammer DS'ens skærme, til et spil, hvor den rammer ved siden af: 0% og 100% lader den være. Touchskærmen på telefonen ændres ikke. Gælder fra næste spil."

#. Settings > Screens' Touch row, its value: the right stick is the stylus
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:838
msgid "Stick as stylus"
msgstr "Pind som pen"

#. Settings > Screens: a row that opens the touch screen's settings (where the touchpad's cursor lands, the right stick as the stylus)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:840
msgid "Touch"
msgstr "Berøring"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:841
msgid "Touch position, and the right stick as stylus."
msgstr "Hvor touchpladens markør lander, og højre pind som pen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:842
msgid "Adjusts where touches land, and lets the right stick drag a touch on the bottom screen. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "Flytter og skalerer, hvor touchpladens markør lander på DS’ens skærme, til et spil, hvor den rammer ved siden af, og lader højre pind trække en berøring hen over den nederste skærm. Trekant på hver linje fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:843
msgid "Touch, left or right"
msgstr "Berøring, venstre eller højre"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:844
msgid "Touch, up or down"
msgstr "Berøring, op eller ned"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:845
msgid "Touch, scale"
msgstr "Berøring, skala"

#. a DS setting: the right stick as the touch screen's stylus (DraStic has it), for Metroid Prime Hunters' aiming
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:847
msgid "The right stick as the stylus"
msgstr "Højre pind som pen"

#. a DS setting: the right stick as the touch screen's stylus (DraStic has it), for Metroid Prime Hunters' aiming
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:847
msgid "Push it to drag a touch on the bottom screen."
msgstr "Skubbet trækker den en berøring hen over den nederste skærm."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:848
msgid "Pushing the right stick touches the middle of the bottom screen and drags as you push, for games that aim by touch. Let go to lift. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Skub højre pind, så berøres den nederste skærm i midten; berøringen trækkes, mens du skubber, og løftes, når du slipper: sådan sigter man i Metroid Prime Hunters. Pindens retninger gør så intet andet. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:855
msgid "DualSense rumble, in games and the launcher."
msgstr "DualSense-vibrationen, i spil og i startprogrammet."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:856
msgid "Off: no rumble in games or the launcher. Applies to every system."
msgstr "Fra: DualSense vibrerer aldrig, hverken i spil eller i startprogrammet. Det samme på alle sider."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:859 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:911
msgid "How far a stick moves before it counts."
msgstr "Hvor langt en pind bevæger sig, før det tæller."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:860
msgid "How far each stick moves before the game sees it. Raise it if there is drift; lower it for finer control. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Hvor langt en pind bevæger sig, før spillet ser det, for begge pinde. Hæv den, hvis en figur eller kameraet driver, når du slipper pinden; sænk den for finere styring. Også i spilmenuen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:868
msgid "Hold it to press repeatedly."
msgstr "Hold den nede, så trykker den af sig selv igen og igen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:869
msgid "Holding this button presses it about 15 times a second, for games that make you mash. None turns it off. Applies to every player."
msgstr "Vælg en DualSense-knap: mens du holder den nede i et spil, trykker og slipper den af sig selv cirka femten gange i sekundet, til spil, hvor du skal hamre løs. Knappen beholder sin tildeling. Ingen slår det fra. Alle spillere på denne side har den."

#. Settings > Controls: a row that opens the buttons' settings (each button, the defaults)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:876
msgid "Each button, and the defaults."
msgstr "Hver knap og standarderne."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:877
msgid "Choose the DualSense button for each Switch button, or reset to default."
msgstr "Hvilken DualSense-knap der trykker på hver af Switchens knapper, og knapperne og dødzonen som fra starten."

#. Settings > Controls > Buttons: the row that opens the list of every button and the DualSense button on it
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:879 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:927
msgid "Each button"
msgstr "Hver knap"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:880
msgid "Choose the DualSense button for each Switch button. By default A is on Circle and B on Cross as on the Switch, + is Options and - is touchpad click."
msgstr "Hvilken DualSense-knap der trykker hver af Switchens knapper. Som standard ligger A på Cirkel og B på Kryds, hvor Switchen har dem; + er Options og - touchpladens klik. Retningsknapperne og pindene forbliver Switchens egne."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:882 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:882 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:932
msgid "Default buttons and deadzone."
msgstr "Standardknapper og dødzone."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:892
msgid "Cross sets this player's controller, motion and buttons."
msgstr "Kryds: denne spillers controller, bevægelse og knapper."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:893
msgid "Set to a real Wii Remote, but none found. Cross to change it."
msgstr "Sat til en rigtig Wii Remote, ingen fundet endnu. Kryds for at ændre."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:894
msgid "This player's controller, motion, vibration, deadzones and buttons. Player 1 is the user who started Playtendoh; other signed-in users are players 2 to 4."
msgstr "Hvad spillet ser i denne spillers hænder, og dens bevægelse, vibration, dødzoner og knapper. Spiller 1 er den loggede bruger, der startede appen; de andre loggede brugeres DualSense-controllere er spiller 2 til 4."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:905
msgid "A on Circle as on the console, or on Cross."
msgstr "Hvor A sidder: på Cirkel som på konsollen, eller på Kryds."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:906
msgid "A on Circle and B on Cross as on the console, or A on Cross and B on Circle as on PlayStation. X and Y swap to match. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "A på Cirkel og B på Kryds, hvor konsollen har dem, eller A på Kryds og B på Cirkel, som PlayStation-spil bekræfter. X og Y byttes tilsvarende. Også i spilmenuen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:910
msgid "Use DualSense motion for games that aim or steer by tilting the 3DS."
msgstr "DualSense-controllerens gyroskop og accelerometer som 3DS’ens egne, til spil hvor man sigter eller styrer ved at vippe den."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:912
msgid "How far a stick moves before the game sees it, for the circle pad and C-stick. Raise it if there is drift; lower it for finer control."
msgstr "Hvor langt en pind bevæger sig, før spillet opdager det, for Circle Pad og C-pind. Hæv den, hvis noget glider, når du slipper pinden; sænk den for finere styring."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:925
msgid "Each button, the turbo button, and the defaults."
msgstr "Hver knap, turboknappen og standarderne."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:926
msgid "Choose the DualSense button for each button, set a turbo button, or reset to default."
msgstr "Hvilken DualSense-knap der trykker på hver knap, en knap der trykker igen og igen, mens du holder den, og styringen som fra starten."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:928
msgid "Choose the DualSense button for each 3DS button. By default A is on Circle and B on Cross as on the 3DS. The circle pad is the left stick, the C-stick the right stick, and the touchpad the touch screen."
msgstr "Hvilken DualSense-knap der trykker på hver af 3DS'ens knapper. Som standard sidder A på Cirkel og B på Kryds, hvor 3DS'en har dem; Circle Pad er venstre pind, C-Stick den højre og touchpladen berøringsskærmen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:929
msgid "Choose the DualSense button for each DS button. By default A is on Circle and B on Cross as on the DS. The left stick is a second D-pad, the touchpad is the touch screen, and holding R3 blows into the mic."
msgstr "Hvilken DualSense-knap der trykker på hver af DS'ens knapper. Som standard sidder A på Cirkel og B på Kryds, hvor DS'en har dem; venstre pind er en ekstra retningsknap, touchpladen berøringsskærmen, og at holde R3 nede puster i mikrofonen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:932
msgid "Default buttons, motion and deadzone."
msgstr "Standardknapper, bevægelse og dødzone."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:932
msgid "The default buttons, motion and deadzone."
msgstr "Standardknapperne, bevægelsen og dødzonen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:941
msgid "Region"
msgstr "Region"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:941
msgid "The emulated 3DS's region."
msgstr "Den emulerede 3DS’ens region."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:942
msgid "Automatic uses each game's region. A game from another region may not start. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Automatisk tager hvert spils egen region. Et spil lavet til en anden region kan nægte at starte eller vise andre sprog. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:944
msgid "The emulated 3DS's language."
msgstr "Den emulerede 3DS’ens sprog."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:945
msgid "The language games use if they follow the console. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Sproget, som spil, der følger konsollens, viser deres tekst på. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:950
msgid "The emulated 3DS's CPU speed."
msgstr "Den emulerede 3DS' processorhastighed."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:951
msgid "Higher can smooth a game that slows down, but needs more power. Lower can speed up some games. 100% is a real 3DS. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Hvor hurtigt den emulerede processor kører i forhold til en 3DS': højere kan stabilisere et spil, der bliver langsomt, hvor en 3DS ikke ville, og kræver mere af PS5'en; lavere kan sætte fart på et spil, der holdes tilbage af sit eget tempo. 100 % er en 3DS. Også i spilmenuen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:953
msgid "Home Menu"
msgstr "HOME-menu"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:953
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Start"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:953
msgid "Run Artic Setup first"
msgstr "Kør Artic Setup først"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:954
msgid "The 3DS Home Menu, from your console's files."
msgstr "3DS’ens HOME-menu, fra din konsols filer."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:955
msgid "Starts the 3DS Home Menu. Needs your console's system files, copied with Artic Setup."
msgstr "Starter 3DS’ens HOME-menu, når Artic Base-opsætningen har kopieret din egen konsols systemfiler (Artic Base)."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:962
msgid "Docked looks sharpest. Handheld runs lighter."
msgstr "I docken: billedet til tv'et. Håndholdt: billedet til konsollens egen skærm."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:963
msgid "Docked draws for a TV (1080p for most games). Handheld draws for the console's screen (720p) and runs lighter. A few games differ between them. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "I docken tegner spil til et tv, så skarpt som muligt (1080p for de fleste); håndholdt til konsollens egen skærm (720p), hvilket kræver mindre af GPU'en. Nogle få spil ser anderledes ud eller spilles anderledes i hver tilstand. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:970
msgid "Automatic gives each game the controller it expects, usually a Pro Controller. If a game doesn't work with it, try a Joy-Con pair. Handheld is player 1 only. Also in the in-game menu."
msgstr "Automatisk giver hvert spil den controller, det tager: en Pro Controller for de fleste. Et spil, der ikke virker med den, virker måske med et Joy-Con-par; Håndholdt er kun spiller 1’s, til spil på konsollens egen skærm. Også i spilmenuen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:978
msgid "Compared to the Switch's speed. Above 100% can let a 30 fps game reach 60, but games that time by frames play faster. None runs as fast as possible. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Som en andel af Switchens egen hastighed. Over 100 % kan et spil holdt til 30 fps nå 60, hvor PS5’en har tid til overs, og et spil, der holder tiden med sine billeder, kører hurtigere. Ingen kører så hurtigt, som PS5’en kan. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:985 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:986
msgid "The language Switch games use. Automatic matches the menus."
msgstr "Det sprog, Switch-spil ser. Automatisk: menuernes."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:992
msgid "Memory"
msgstr "Hukommelse"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:993 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:994
msgid "4 GB matches the Switch. More is for mods that need it. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "4 GB er Switchens egen. Mere til mods, der beder om det. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1004
msgid "Compact memory"
msgstr "Kompakt hukommelse"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1004
msgid "Saves memory for the biggest games."
msgstr "Holder spillets mest tomme hukommelse lille, til de største spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1006
msgid "Precompile code"
msgstr "Forudkompiler kode"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1006
msgid "Prepares code from past sessions ahead of time, for fewer hitches."
msgstr "Kompilerer koden fra tidligere sessioner, før spillet skal bruge den: færre hak."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1009
msgid "Fast GPU"
msgstr "Hurtig GPU"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1009
msgid "Lowest GPU accuracy. Faster, but some effects may look wrong."
msgstr "Edens laveste GPU-præcision: hurtigere, og nogle effekter tegnes måske forkert."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1011
msgid "Unsafe CPU"
msgstr "Usikker CPU"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1011
msgid "Faster, less exact maths. A few games misbehave."
msgstr "Hurtigere, upræcise kommatalsberegninger. Hurtigere; nogle få spil opfører sig forkert."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1013
msgid "Unsafe DMA"
msgstr "Usikker DMA"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1013
msgid "Faster memory transfers. A few games show glitches."
msgstr "Edens usikre DMA-præcision: hurtigere, nogle få spil viser fejl."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1015
msgid "Reactive flushing"
msgstr "Reaktiv tømning"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1015
msgid "Keeps some effects correct. Off is faster, but some effects break."
msgstr "Holder effekter, der læser GPU'ens arbejde tilbage, korrekte. Fra er hurtigere; nogle går i stykker."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1017
msgid "Skip cache invalidation"
msgstr "Spring cache-ugyldiggørelse over"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1017
msgid "Faster, and rarely causes problems."
msgstr "Færre ugyldiggørelser af CPU-cachen: hurtigere, sjældent forkert."

#. Settings > Performance: a row that opens Eden's accuracy shortcuts (Fast GPU, Unsafe CPU, ...); its value: how many are changed
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1033
msgid "Accuracy"
msgstr "Præcision"

#. Settings > Performance: a row that opens Eden's accuracy shortcuts (Fast GPU, Unsafe CPU, ...); its value: how many are changed
#. a group of an emulator's options in Settings: how many it holds, and how many are not the emulator's own values
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1033 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1783
msgid "{0} changed"
msgid_plural "{0} changed"
msgstr[0] "{0} ændret"
msgstr[1] "{0} ændret"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1034
msgid "Speed shortcuts. Faster, but less exact."
msgstr "Edens genveje: hurtigere, nogle mindre nøjagtige."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1035
msgid "These trade accuracy for speed, for every Switch game or just one. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "Hurtig GPU, Usikker CPU, Usikker DMA, Reaktiv tømning og Spring cache-ugyldiggørelse over bytter nøjagtighed for hastighed, for hvert Switch-spil eller kun for ét. Trekant på hver linje fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1042
msgid "The emulated DS's language."
msgstr "Den emulerede DS' sprog."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1043
msgid "The DS's language, used by many games. Japanese, English, French, German, Italian, Spanish and Chinese; others use English. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "DS'ens eget sprog, som mange spil følger. DS'en har japansk, engelsk, fransk, tysk, italiensk, spansk og kinesisk; alle andre sprog bliver engelsk. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1046
msgid "Found in melonds/bios."
msgstr "Fundet i melonds/bios."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1046
msgid "Not found: the built-in BIOS is used."
msgstr "Ikke fundet: melonDS' indbyggede BIOS kører spillene."

#. {0} is the folder for a DS's own BIOS and firmware dumps
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1048
msgid "Uses bios7.bin, bios9.bin and firmware.bin from your own DS, in {0}. Without them, most games run fine on the built-in BIOS. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "bios7.bin, bios9.bin og firmware.bin, dumpet fra din egen DS, i {0}: melonDS kører på dem, når de er der, og dette er slået til. Uden dem kører dens egne erstatninger (FreeBIOS) de fleste spil lige så godt. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1051
msgid "Noise"
msgstr "Støj"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1051
msgid "Silence"
msgstr "Stilhed"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1051
msgid "A recording"
msgstr "En optagelse"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1052
msgid "What the DS hears while R3 is held. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Det, DS'en hører, mens R3 holdes nede. Gælder fra næste spil."

#. {0} is melonDS's folder, /data/melonds or where the DS's files are; keep <the game's file name> as a placeholder
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1054
msgid "A 16-bit mono WAV (8,000 to 48,000 Hz, up to 16 MB): {0}/microphone/<the game's file name>.wav for one game, or {0}/microphone.wav for all. It loops while R3 is held."
msgstr "En optagelse er en WAV-fil, 16-bit mono-PCM ved 8.000 til 48.000 Hz og op til 16 MB: {0}/microphone/<spillets filnavn>.wav til ét spil, {0}/microphone.wav til de andre. Den afspilles igen og igen, mens R3 holdes nede, fra starten hver gang. Der optages intet fra en mikrofon."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1055
msgid "GBA cartridge in Slot-2"
msgstr "GBA-kassette i stik 2"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1056
msgid "For DS games that read a GBA game in the second slot. It does not play GBA games."
msgstr "Til de DS-spil, der læser et GBA-spil i deres andet stik, som Pokémons Pal Park. Den spiller ikke GBA-spil."

#. {0} is melonDS's folder, /data/melonds or where the DS's files are
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1058
msgid "Put the GBA game in {0}/slot2 named like the DS game, ending .gba, with its .sav if it has one. Its save is then kept in {0}/slot2-saves; your files are not changed. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Læg GBA-spillet i {0}/slot2 med DS-spillets filnavn, der ender på .gba, og dets .sav ved siden af, hvis det har en. Kassettens gemte data holdes derefter i {0}/slot2-saves, og de filer, du lægger der, ændres aldrig. Et DS-spil uden kassette der starter med stikket tomt. Gælder fra næste spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1063 port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:211 port/main_ps5.cpp:578 port/main_ps5.cpp:581 port/main_ps5.cpp:582
msgid "Switch 2 games"
msgstr "Switch 2-spil"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1065
msgid "Where your games are. Cross picks another."
msgstr "Hvor dine spil er. Kryds vælger en anden mappe."

#. {0} is the app's data folder: /data/ps5cemu, or the PS5CEMU-HAR-data folder on the drive the app is installed on
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1067
msgid "Wii U games: .wua, .wud, .wux, folders with code, content and meta, or in .zip, .7z or .rar. Encrypted .wud and .wux need keys in {0}/keys.txt."
msgstr "Dine Wii U-spil: .wua, .wud, .wux eller mapper med code, content og meta, alene eller i .zip-, .7z- eller .rar-arkiver. Krypterede .wud og .wux skal have deres nøgler i {0}/keys.txt."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1068
msgid "3DS games: decrypted .3ds, .cci, .cxi, .3dsx or compressed dumps, or in .zip, .7z or .rar. Install CIA files with Install a CIA file. Encrypted games won't start: decrypt them on your 3DS with GodMode9."
msgstr "Dine 3DS-spil: .3ds eller .cci, .cxi, .3dsx og Azahars komprimerede dumps, dekrypterede, alene eller i .zip-, .7z- eller .rar-arkiver, her eller i mapperne i den. CIA-filer installeres (Installér en CIA-fil). Krypterede dumps starter ikke, med eller uden nøgler: dekryptér dem først på din 3DS (GodMode9)."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1069 port/main_ps5.cpp:579
msgid "Switch 2 game folders need ExeFS and RomFS. Put each game in its own folder; keep updates and DLC where Lichii expects them."
msgstr "Switch 2-spilmapper skal indeholde ExeFS og RomFS. Læg hvert spil i sin egen mappe; behold opdateringer og DLC, hvor Lichii forventer dem."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1070
msgid "Switch games: .nsp and .xci files, each alone or in its own folder with its update and DLC."
msgstr "Dine Switch-spil: .nsp- og .xci-filer, alene eller hvert i sin egen mappe med dets opdatering og DLC."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1071
msgid "DS games: .nds files, or in .zip, .7z or .rar, here or in subfolders."
msgstr "Dine DS-spil: .nds-filer, alene eller i .zip-, .7z- eller .rar-arkiver, her eller i dens undermapper."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1072 port/frontend/shell/shares.cpp:292
msgid "Looking…"
msgstr "Leder…"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1072
msgid "Search this system's folder again."
msgstr "Denne sides mappe, igen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1073
msgid "Searches this system's folder again for added or removed games."
msgstr "Gennemgår denne sides mappe igen: spil, der er tilføjet siden, kommer frem, og spil, der er fjernet, forsvinder."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1076
msgid "Look on network shares at every start"
msgstr "Gennemgå netværksdelinger ved hver start"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1077
msgid "Off shows the games found last time, at once."
msgstr "Fra: spillene fra sidst, med det samme."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1078
msgid "Searching a network share each time can be slow with a large library. Off shows the games found last time right away; use Look for games now after adding some. Folders on the PS5 or USB are always searched."
msgstr "En spilmappe på en netværksdeling gennemgås, hver gang dens side åbnes, og appen starter igen efter hvert spil: med et stort bibliotek er det en lang ventetid. Slået fra viser siden med det samme de spil, den fandt der sidst, og Led efter spil nu leder igen, når du har tilføjet nogle. Mapper på PS5'en eller et USB-drev gennemgås hver gang uanset."

#. Settings > Game files' Keys and firmware row, its value when the firmware is missing and the keys are there
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1084 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1099
msgid "Firmware missing"
msgstr "Firmware mangler"

#. Settings > Game files' Keys and firmware row, its value when prod.keys is missing and the firmware is there
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1085 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1101
msgid "Keys missing"
msgstr "Nøgler mangler"

#. Settings > Game files' Keys and firmware row, its value when prod.keys is missing and the firmware is there
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1085 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1101
msgid "Missing"
msgstr "Mangler"

#. Settings > Game files: one row for the Switch's keys (prod.keys) and its firmware, which Eden needs
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1086 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1103
msgid "Keys and firmware"
msgstr "Nøgler og firmware"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1088 port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:333
msgid "Firmware is missing: some games need it"
msgstr "Firmware mangler: nogle spil har brug for den"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1088
msgid "Lichii found keys and firmware."
msgstr "Lichii fandt nøgler og firmware."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1089
msgid "Put your own prod.keys in {0}/keys. Neither Playtendoh nor Lichii includes keys."
msgstr "Læg din egen prod.keys i {0}/keys. Hverken Playtendoh eller Lichii indeholder nøgler."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1090
msgid "Put your own Switch firmware files in {0}/firmware. Neither app includes firmware."
msgstr "Læg dine egne Switch-firmwarefiler i {0}/firmware. Ingen af appsene indeholder firmware."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1105 port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:311
msgid "No firmware yet: many games need it to start"
msgstr "Ingen firmware endnu: mange spil skal bruge den for at starte"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1106
msgid "Your keys are ready."
msgstr "Eden kan læse dine spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1107 port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:304
msgid "Switch games need your own console's keys: prod.keys (and title.keys) from your Switch, in {0}/keys. Playtendoh does not include keys."
msgstr "Eden læser Switch-spil med din egen konsols nøgler: prod.keys (og title.keys), hentet fra din Switch, i {0}/keys. Playtendoh indeholder ingen nøgler."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1110 port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:314
msgid "Many Switch games need firmware: the .nca files from your Switch, in {0}/firmware. Playtendoh does not include firmware."
msgstr "Mange Switch-spil skal bruge konsollens egne systemfiler: dens firmwares .nca-filer, hentet fra din Switch, i {0}/firmware. Playtendoh indeholder ingen firmware."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1118 port/frontend/shell/shares.cpp:536
msgid "Network shares"
msgstr "Netværksdelinger"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1118
msgid "{0} share"
msgid_plural "{0} shares"
msgstr[0] "{0} deling"
msgstr[1] "{0} delinger"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1119
msgid "Games on a computer or a NAS, over SMB or NFS."
msgstr "Spil på en computer eller NAS, via SMB eller NFS."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1120
msgid "Add a folder shared by a computer or NAS, then choose a games folder on it in the folder browser. Nothing is written to it; saves and installs stay on the PS5. Wired is better than Wi-Fi."
msgstr "En mappe, som en Windows-, macOS- eller Linux-computer eller en NAS deler, læst, hvor den er: tilføj den her, og vælg så en spilmappe på den med mappebrowseren, hvor hver deling er en fane. Der skrives aldrig noget til den; gemte data og installationer bliver på PS5’en. Til Wii U-spil virker et kabel bedre end Wi-Fi."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1125 port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:250
msgid "Wii U disc keys"
msgstr "Wii U-disknøgler"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1125 port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:252
msgid "keys.txt found"
msgstr "keys.txt fundet"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1126
msgid "Only encrypted .wud and .wux need them."
msgstr "Kun krypterede .wud og .wux skal bruge dem."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1126 port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:252
msgid "keys.txt is missing: only encrypted .wud and .wux need it"
msgstr "keys.txt mangler: kun krypterede .wud og .wux skal bruge den"

#. {0} is the app's data folder: /data/ps5cemu, or the PS5CEMU-HAR-data folder on the drive the app is installed on
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1128 port/frontend/shell/setup.cpp:255
msgid "Encrypted .wud and .wux need their disc keys in {0}/keys.txt, one per line. Other formats need none."
msgstr "Krypterede .wud- og .wux-dumps skal have deres disknøgler i {0}/keys.txt, én pr. linje. Dekrypterede dumps, .wua-filer og mapper med code, content og meta skal ikke bruge nogen."

#. Settings > Game files: a row that opens Updates and DLC and Mods from USB
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1130
msgid "Updates, DLC and mods"
msgstr "Opdateringer, DLC og mods"

#. Settings > Game files: a row that opens Updates and DLC and Mods from USB
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1130
msgid "Install from your drives, and add mods."
msgstr "Installationer fra dine drev og Cemu-mods."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1131
msgid "Install updates and DLC found on your drives, and copy mods from ps5cemu/mods on a USB drive. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "Opdateringer og DLC fundet på dine drev, hver installeret i Wii U’ens lager med ét tryk, og Cemu-mods kopieret fra mappen ps5cemu/mods på et USB-drev. Trekant på hver linje fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1132
msgid "Found on your drives. Install each with one press."
msgstr "Fundet på dine drev, hver installeret med ét tryk."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1133
msgid "Searches USB drives, extended storage, the games folder and /data for updates, DLC and games (folders with code, content and meta), listed by game. Cross installs one, Square installs all new ones. Triangle chooses another folder."
msgstr "Leder på alle tilsluttede USB-drev og udvidede lagre, i spilmappen og i /data efter opdateringer, DLC og spil (mapper med code, content og meta) og viser dem pr. spil sammen med det, der er installeret nu. Kryds installerer én, Firkant alle nye; hver havner i Wii U's lager (mlc01), som Cemus »Install game title, update or DLC« gør. Trekant vælger der en hvilken som helst anden mappe."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1134
msgid "Mods from USB"
msgstr "Mods fra USB"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1134
msgid "Mods from ps5cemu/mods on your drives."
msgstr "Cemu-mods fra mappen ps5cemu/mods på dine drev."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1135
msgid "Copies mods from ps5cemu/mods on a USB drive. Each appears, off, on its game's Graphic packs page. A mod is a graphic pack (a folder with rules.txt), or a folder with content and aoc folders inside a folder named with the game's title ID. You can also add mods from a game's menu. See docs/GUIDE.md on GitHub."
msgstr "Kopierer modsene i et USB-drevs ps5cemu/mods-mappe til appens grafikpakker, hvor hver vises på sit spils side Grafikpakker, slået fra, indtil du slår den til. En mod er en grafikpakke til Cemu (en mappe med en rules.txt) eller, for en, der er delt uden den, en mappe med mapperne content og aoc i en mappe, der er navngivet efter spillets titel-id. Et spils menu har også Tilføj mods fra USB, som giver sådanne mods det spil. Guiden på GitHub, docs/GUIDE.md, fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1139
msgid "Install a CIA file"
msgstr "Installer en CIA-fil"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1139
msgid "A game, an update or DLC."
msgstr "Et spil, en opdatering eller et DLC."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1140
msgid "Installs a CIA file. Updates and DLC join their game; games join the library. Circle cancels."
msgstr "Installerer en CIA i 3DS’ens lager, som Azahars Install CIA: en opdatering eller et DLC kommer til sit spil, og et spil kommer i biblioteket. Cirkel annullerer, mens det kører."

#. Settings > Game files: a row opening the list of every system's folder; {0} how many have a folder of their own, {1} how many systems
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1163 port/frontend/shell/shell.cpp:2879
msgid "A folder for each system"
msgstr "En mappe til hvert system"

#. Settings > Game files: a row opening the list of every system's folder; {0} how many have a folder of their own, {1} how many systems
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1163
msgid "{0} of {1} on their own"
msgstr "{0} af {1} alene"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1164
msgid "Keep a system's files together with the rest, or in a folder of its own."
msgstr "Opbevar et systems filer sammen med resten eller i en egen mappe."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1165
msgid "Saves, BIOS files and settings for every system are kept together in {0}, unless you give a system its own folder. Moving is quick and nothing is deleted. Playtendoh restarts to do it. Some emulators always use their own folder."
msgstr "Gemmer, BIOS-filer og indstillinger for hvert system gemmes sammen i {0}, medmindre du giver et system sin egen mappe. Flytning er hurtig, og intet slettes. Playtendoh genstarter for at gøre det. Nogle emulatorer bruger altid deres egen mappe."

#. Settings > Game files: a system whose emulator always keeps a folder of its own
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1172
msgid "Its emulator always keeps its own folder."
msgstr "Dens emulator beholder altid sin egen mappe."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1179
msgid "Moves the next time Playtendoh starts."
msgstr "Flytter næste gang Playtendoh starter."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1180
msgid "On: this system's files get their own folder. Off: kept with the rest."
msgstr "Til: Systemets filer får deres egen mappe. Off: holdes med resten."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1181
msgid "Own folder"
msgstr "Egen mappe"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1181
msgid "Together"
msgstr "Sammen"

#. {0} is a file or folder already where one would be moved to
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1186
msgid "Cannot move"
msgstr "Kan ikke flyttes"

#. {0} is a file or folder already where one would be moved to
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1186
msgid "In the way: {0}"
