msgstr "Om bjælken viser DS-siden (melonDS). Skjult beholdes dens spil og indstillinger, og de kommer tilbage, når den slås til igen. Mindst én side forbliver slået til."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1497
msgid "3DS"
msgstr "3DS-siden"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1497
msgid "3DS games, in the bar."
msgstr "Azahars spil i bjælken."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1498
msgid "Show the 3DS in the bar. Hidden systems keep their games and settings. At least one stays on."
msgstr "Om bjælken viser 3DS-siden (Azahar). Skjult beholdes dens spil og indstillinger, og de kommer tilbage, når den slås til igen. Mindst én side forbliver slået til."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1500
msgid "3D box art"
msgstr "3D boks art"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1500
msgid "Covers as boxes, with a spine."
msgstr "Omslag som æsker, med ryg."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1501
msgid "Each cover drawn as its box, turned a little, with its spine. Off: flat covers."
msgstr "Hvert omslag tegnet som sin æske, vendt lidt med sin rygrad. Slukket: flade betræk."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1502
msgid "Game pictures behind menus"
msgstr "Spilbilleder bag menuerne"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1502
msgid "The selected game's cover, blurred, behind the menus."
msgstr "Det valgte spils omslag, blødgjort, bag skærmene."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1503
msgid "The selected game's picture fills the background, blurred and dimmed. Off: just the game's colours."
msgstr "Det valgte spils billede fylder skærmen bag menuerne, blødgjort og dæmpet, så det at flytte markeringen ændrer hele skærmen. Fra: kun spillets farver."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1504
msgid "Library filters"
msgstr "Biblioteksfiltre"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1504
msgid "A row of filters above the list."
msgstr "Alle, Tilføjet for nylig, Favoritter: en række over listen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1505
msgid "Filters above the list: All, Recently added (last 30 days), Favourites, and for Wii U, Graphic packs on. Off: just Sort and Search."
msgstr "En række filtre over bibliotekets liste: Alle, Tilføjet for nylig (de seneste 30 dage), Favoritter og på Wii U-siden Grafikpakker slået til, hver med sit antal. Fra: listen har alle spil, og Sortér og Søg er alt, hvad den behøver."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1513 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1523
msgid "Larger text"
msgstr "Større tekst"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1513 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1525
msgid "High contrast"
msgstr "Høj kontrast"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1514 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1527
msgid "Reduce motion"
msgstr "Reducer bevægelse"

#. Settings > Launcher: a row that opens Larger text, High contrast, Reduce motion and Hold to confirm
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1520
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Tilgængelighed"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1521
msgid "Larger text, high contrast, reduced motion and hold to confirm."
msgstr "Større tekst, høj kontrast, mindre bevægelse, hold nede for at bekræfte."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1522
msgid "Text size, contrast, motion, and how long to hold Cross to confirm. Press Triangle on each for more."
msgstr "Teksten et trin større, uigennemsigtige paneler med tekst i fuld styrke, overtoninger i stedet for bevægelse, og hvor længe Kryds holdes nede for det, der ikke kan fortrydes. Trekant på hver linje fortæller mere."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1523
msgid "Makes all text a step larger."
msgstr "Hver tekststørrelse et trin større."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1524
msgid "Makes every text size one step larger."
msgstr "Hver tekststil et trin større: billedtekster fra 20 til 23, brødtekst fra 26 til 30."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1525
msgid "Opaque panels, full-strength text, a thicker ring."
msgstr "Uigennemsigtige paneler, fuld tekst, en tykkere ring."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1526
msgid "Opaque panels instead of glass, all text at full strength, a thicker focus ring and no grain or pictures behind the menus."
msgstr "Uigennemsigtige paneler i stedet for glas, al tekst i fuld styrke, en tykkere markeringsring og ingen kornethed eller billeder bag menuerne."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1527
msgid "Fades instead of motion."
msgstr "Overtoninger i stedet for bevægelse."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1528
msgid "Animations become short fades, and the background stays still."
msgstr "Fjedre bliver til korte overtoninger; intet driver, ånder eller stiger bag menuerne."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1529
msgid "Hold to confirm"
msgstr "Hold nede for at bekræfte"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1529
msgid "How long to hold Cross for actions that can't be undone."
msgstr "Hvor længe Kryds holdes nede for det, der ikke kan fortrydes."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1530
msgid "Actions like clearing caches or resetting controls need Cross held to confirm. This sets how long."
msgstr "Rydning af cacher, Artic Setup og nulstilling af styring bekræftes ved at holde nede, aldrig ved at trykke to gange. Så længe."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1532
msgid "Run first-time setup again."
msgstr "Valgene fra første start igen: sider, tema, knapper."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1533
msgid "Shows the first-time setup again: language, systems, theme, buttons, music, vibration and game pictures."
msgstr "Siden, første start åbner på: sproget, siderne, temaet, A og B, musikken, vibration og spillenes billeder, på én side."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1537
msgid "Checks storage, performance, games, keys and box art."
msgstr "Lager, genkompilere, spil, nøgler og omslag, tjekket."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1538
msgid "Each check shows its status and what to do. It also appears on first start, and when a check fails."
msgstr "Hvert tjek har en status, hvad den betyder, og hvad man skal gøre. Det vises også ved første start, og når et tjek fejler, mens appen starter."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1539
msgid "Copy logs to USB"
msgstr "Kopiér logfiler til USB"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1539
msgid "Copy logs to a USB drive for a bug report."
msgstr "De logfiler, en fejlrapport skal bruge, til et USB-drev."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1540
msgid "Copies the last five sessions' logs and the settings into a dated folder on a USB drive, to attach to a report."
msgstr "Kopierer de seneste fem sessioners logfiler og indstillingerne til en dateret mappe på et USB-drev, til at vedhæfte en rapport."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1542 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1545
msgid "Clear shader caches"
msgstr "Ryd shadercacher"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1543 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1546
msgid "Try this if a game crashes."
msgstr "Til et spil, der går ned på grund af en dårlig cache."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1543
msgid "Deletes the Wii U shader caches. Games rebuild them, so the first few minutes may stutter."
msgstr "Sletter Cemus shadercacher. Spillene bygger dem igen, mens de kører: de første minutter hakker."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1547
msgid "Deletes the 3DS shader caches. Games rebuild them, so the first few minutes may stutter."
msgstr "Sletter Azahars shadercacher. Spillene bygger dem igen, mens de kører: de første minutter hakker."

#. Settings > Diagnostics: the copies of games unpacked from their archives (.zip, .7z...), kept for their next start
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1557
msgid "Unpacked games"
msgstr "Udpakkede spil"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1561
msgid "Games unpacked from archives, kept for faster starts."
msgstr "Spil fra arkiver, gemt udpakket til deres næste start."

#. {0} is the folder they are kept in
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1563
msgid "Deletes unpacked copies of archived games in {0}. They unpack again next time. Old copies are removed automatically when space runs low."
msgstr "Sletter kopierne af spil, der er pakket ud af deres arkiver, gemt i {0}. Hvert spil pakkes ud igen, næste gang det starter; når der skal bruges plads, forsvinder de kopier, der er brugt for længst tid siden, af sig selv."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1573
msgid "Wii U games' volume"
msgstr "Wii U-spillenes lydstyrke"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1573
msgid "3DS games' volume"
msgstr "3DS-spillenes lydstyrke"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1573
msgid "Switch games' volume"
msgstr "Switch-spillenes lydstyrke"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1573
msgid "DS games' volume"
msgstr "DS-spillenes lydstyrke"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1574
msgid "The games' sound."
msgstr "Spillenes lyd."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1574
msgid "Game volume for this system. Left and Right change it by 10%."
msgstr "Spillenes lyd på denne side. Venstre og Højre ændrer den med 10 %."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1577
msgid "GamePad speaker"
msgstr "GamePad-højttaler"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1577
msgid "GamePad sound from the DualSense speaker."
msgstr "Wii U GamePad’ens egen lyd, på DualSense."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1578
msgid "Plays GamePad speaker sounds from player 1's DualSense. Many games send all their sound there too, so it's off by default. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Lydene, som spil afspiller i Wii U GamePad’ens højttaler, fra spiller 1’s DualSense-højttaler. Mange spil sender også al deres lyd derhen, så den er slået fra, medmindre du vil have den. Gælder fra næste spil."

#. Settings > System: a row that opens the launcher's music and menu sounds
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1585
msgid "Launcher sound"
msgstr "Startprogrammets lyd"

#. Settings > System: a row that opens the launcher's music and menu sounds
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1585
msgid "The menus' music and sounds."
msgstr "Menuernes musik og lyde."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1586
msgid "Menu music, its volume, and menu sounds. The same for every system."
msgstr "Musikken i menuerne, hvor høj den er, og lydene, når du bevæger dig og vælger. Alle sider har de samme."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1587
msgid "Launcher music"
msgstr "Startprogrammets musik"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1587
msgid "Music that plays in the menus."
msgstr "Musik, der spiller i menuerne."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1588
msgid "Built-in music, your own, or none. For your own, put MP3 or WAV files in {0}."
msgstr "Startprogrammets egen musik, en af dine eller ingen. Brug din egen ved at lægge MP3- eller WAV-filer i {0}; de vises her. Alle sider spiller det samme."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1590
msgid "Music volume"
msgstr "Musiklydstyrke"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1590
msgid "Menu music volume."
msgstr "Hvor højt menuernes musik spiller."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1591
msgid "How loud the launcher's music is. Left and Right change it by 10%."
msgstr "Hvor højt startprogrammets musik spiller. Venstre og højre ændrer den med 10 %."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1592
msgid "Menu sounds"
msgstr "Menulyde"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1592
msgid "The sounds of moving and choosing."
msgstr "Lydene, når man flytter og vælger."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1593
msgid "The launcher's sounds as you move, choose and go back."
msgstr "Startprogrammets lyde, når du flytter, vælger og går tilbage."

#. Settings > System on the Wii U side: a row that opens Cemu's emulated portals (Skylanders, Disney Infinity, LEGO Dimensions)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1602
msgid "Emulated toy portals."
msgstr "Cemus emulerede portaler."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1607
msgid "For the Skylanders games."
msgstr "Til Skylanders-spillene."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1608
msgid "For Disney Infinity 3.0."
msgstr "Til Disney Infinity 3.0."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1609
msgid "For LEGO Dimensions."
msgstr "Til LEGO Dimensions."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1610
msgid "An emulated portal, connected when a game starts. Place figures from the in-game menu under USB devices; dumps go in {0}. Real portals are not supported."
msgstr "Cemus emulerede portal, tilsluttet når et spil starter. I spillet sætter menuens kategori USB-enheder figurer på den: dumps i {0}. En rigtig portal tilsluttet PS5'en understøttes ikke."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1621
msgid ""
"Shows {0} in a browser on a phone, tablet or computer on your network, with touch. Scan the code or open the address. Buttons and sound stay on the PS5.\n"
"While a browser is open, games may run a little slower. Anyone on your network can open it, so turn it off on shared networks.\n"
"Applies to every system, and is also in the in-game menu."
msgstr ""
"{0} i en hvilken som helst browser på PS5'ens netværk, på en telefon, tablet eller computer, uden at installere noget, og berøringerne sendes tilbage til spillet. Scan koden, der vises her, eller åbn adressen. Knapperne bliver på DualSense, og lyden bliver på PS5'en.\n"
"Mens en browser viser den, kopierer PS5'en skærmen op til 30 gange i sekundet, så et spil kan køre lidt langsommere; uden en browser koster det intet. Enhver enhed på dit netværk kan åbne siden, så slå den fra på et delt netværk.\n"
"Én kontakt for alle sider (GamePaddens skærm er spiller 1's), også i et spils menu (klik på touchpladen + OPTIONS). Efter dolphin78s idé og prototype (#38)."

#. a row that opens the remote touch screen's page: the game's second screen in a phone's browser, and its code to scan
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1624 port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1626
msgid "Show {0} on a phone or tablet, with touch."
msgstr "{0} i en telefons eller tablets browser, med berøring."

#. the Switch side's players, the people (Eden's user profiles), each with saves of their own; not a number of players
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1670
msgctxt "switch"
msgid "Players"
msgstr "Spillere"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1673 port/frontend/shell/switch_extras.cpp:91
msgid "Remembered for this PS5 user. Each player has their own saves."
msgstr "Huskes for denne PS5-bruger. Hver spiller har sine egne gemte data; intet flyttes eller slettes."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1702
msgid "Back to defaults"
msgstr "Tilbage til standard"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1704
msgid "This game goes back to the system's settings."
msgstr "Dette spil bruger sidens indstillinger igen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1705
msgid "Clears this game's own settings so it uses the system's settings again."
msgstr "Rydder dette spils egne indstillinger, så det bruger sidens indstillinger igen, som alle andre spil."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1792
msgid "Back to the emulator's own values"
msgstr "Tilbage til emulatorens egne værdier"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1793
msgid "Nothing changed"
msgstr "Intet ændrede sig"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1795
msgid "Resets every option above to {0}'s default, for every game on this system."
msgstr "Nulstiller alle ovenstående muligheder til {0}'s standard for hvert spil på dette system."

#. a Wii U account by its number, when its name cannot be read
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1870
msgid "Account {0}"
msgstr "Konto {0}"

#. a Wii U game's save that all its accounts share
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1872
msgid "Every account's"
msgstr "Alle kontis"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1873
msgid "Save data"
msgstr "Gemte data"

#. a 3DS game's extra data (its extdata), which some games keep beside their saves
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1875
msgid "Extra data"
msgstr "Ekstra data"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1876
msgid "{0} save state"
msgid_plural "{0} save states"
msgstr[0] "{0} gemt tilstand"
msgstr[1] "{0} gemte tilstande"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1877
msgid "The GBA cartridge's save"
msgstr "GBA-kassettens gemte data"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1937
msgid "Hold to move to saves-before on the PS5. You can restore it later."
msgstr "Holdt: flyttes til saves-before på PS5’en, så den kan komme tilbage."

#. {0} is the app's data folder: /data/ps5cemu, or the PS5CEMU-HAR-data folder on the drive the app is installed on
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1939
msgid "Hold Cross to move these files to {0}/saves-before, in a dated folder. The game starts without them next time. Nothing is deleted."
msgstr "Når du holder Kryds nede, flyttes filerne til {0}/saves-before, i en mappe med dato og klokkeslæt, og spillet starter uden dem næste gang. Intet slettes: kopiér dem tilbage derfra (eller gendan en sikkerhedskopi) for at få dem igen."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1949
msgid "They appear here once the game has saved."
msgstr "De vises her, så snart spillet har gemt."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1962
msgid "Copy this game's saves to a USB drive."
msgstr "Spillets gemte data til det første USB-drev."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1963
msgid "Copies this game's saves and save states to PS5CEMU-HAR-saves on the first USB drive, in a dated folder."
msgstr "Kopierer spillets gemte data (alle kontis, på Wii U) og dets gemte tilstande til PS5CEMU-HAR-saves på det første tilsluttede USB-drev, i en mappe med dato og klokkeslæt, på samme måde som en sikkerhedskopi af alle siders gemte data."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1979
msgid "No backup with this game's saves was found."
msgstr "Ingen sikkerhedskopi på de tilsluttede drev har gemte data for dette spil."

#. {0} is the app's data folder: /data/ps5cemu, or the PS5CEMU-HAR-data folder on the drive the app is installed on
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1981
msgid "Restores only this game's saves from the chosen backup. Current saves are moved to {0}/saves-before first, so nothing is lost."
msgstr "Lægger spillets gemte data fra den valgte sikkerhedskopi tilbage, hvor de kom fra, og intet andet. Dets nuværende gemte data flyttes først til {0}/saves-before, så intet går tabt."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1990
msgid "Copy the save to USB"
msgstr "Kopiér de gemte data til USB"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1991
msgid "Copies the chosen player's save to USB/PS5-ECAM-exports, for use in another emulator."
msgstr "Den valgte spillers gemte data, i USB/PS5-ECAM-exports, som mapper, en anden emulator kan tage."

#. a Switch game's save taken from standalone ProsperoEden on the PS5 or from a USB drive
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1996
msgid "Import a save"
msgstr "Hent gemte data"

#. no save of this Switch game in standalone ProsperoEden or on a USB drive
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2002
msgid "No saves found to import"
msgstr "Ingen i ProsperoEden eller på et USB-drev"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2003
msgid "Import from another Switch emulator on this PS5, USB/PS5-ECAM-imports/<title ID>, or a Ryujinx folder in USB/Ryujinx. The replaced save is kept."
msgstr "Fra den selvstændige ProsperoEden på denne PS5 (hver af dens spilleres gemte data), USB/PS5-ECAM-imports/<titel-id> eller en kopi af Ryujinx' mappe i USB/Ryujinx, som den valgte spillers gemte data. De gemte data, de erstatter, beholdes."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2004
msgid "Choose the player first in Settings > Players and saves > Players. Files are checked before replacing, and the old save is kept in save-transfer-recovery."
msgstr "Vælg først spilleren under Indstillinger > Spillere og gemte data > Spillere. Hver fil kopieres og kontrolleres, før de gemte data erstattes, og de erstattede gemte data beholdes i Edens mappe save-transfer-recovery."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2017
msgid "{0} min"
msgstr "{0} min."

#. a play time: hours, then minutes
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2019
msgid "{0} h {1} min"
msgstr "{0} t. {1} min."

#. Settings > Play time, a side's line: {1} the side (Wii U, 3DS, DS, Switch), {2} its play time, {0} how many games
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2051
msgid "{1}: {2}, {0} game"
msgid_plural "{1}: {2}, {0} games"
msgstr[0] "{1}: {2}, {0} spil"
msgstr[1] "{1}: {2}, {0} spil"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2054
msgid "Nothing played yet. Play time shows here and on each game's page."
msgstr "Intet spillet endnu. Et spils tid tæller fra start til slut og vises her og på dets side."

#. Settings > Play time: every side's play time added up
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2057
msgid "In all: {0}"
msgstr "I alt: {0}"

#. Settings > Play time: every side's play time added up
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2057
msgid "Most played"
msgstr "Mest spillede"

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2077
msgid ""
"Your own theme: put a file such as sunset.json in {0}/themes. It appears under Theme by its name:\n"
"{{\"name\": \"Sunset\", \"base\": \"midnight\", \"colours\": {{\"wiiu\": \"#ff7a59\", \"ink-0\": \"#120806\"}}, \"corners\": 0.5, \"motif\": \"none\"}}\n"
"base: a theme to start from (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: ink-0 to ink-2 (the background), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds and nx (each system's), glass, line, good, warn, bad and focus, as #rrggbb. corners: 0 square to 1.5 round. motif: side, none or eden."
msgstr ""
"Dit eget tema: en fil som sunset.json i {0}/themes, der læses, når appen starter, og derefter vises under Tema med sit navn:\n"
"{{\"name\": \"Sunset\", \"base\": \"midnight\", \"colours\": {{\"wiiu\": \"#ff7a59\", \"ink-0\": \"#120806\"}}, \"corners\": 0.5, \"motif\": \"none\"}}\n"
"base: et tema at tage udgangspunkt i (light, link-jack, classic, midnight, eden). colours: ink-0 til ink-2 (baggrunden), text, wiiu, n3ds, nds og nx (hver sides), glass, line, good, warn, bad og focus, som #rrggbb. corners: 0 firkantet til 1.5 rund. motif: side, none eller eden."

#. {0} is Eden's data folder; {1} its game files folder (the same one unless another was chosen)
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2081
msgid "Saves: {0}/user/nand/user/save. Updates and DLC: beside a game, in its own folder, or in {1}/updates. Mods and cheats: {1}/mods. Covers and names: {0}/covers."
msgstr "Gemte spil: {0}/user/nand/user/save. Opdateringer og DLC: ved siden af et spil, i dets egen mappe, eller i {1}/updates. Mods og snydekoder: {1}/mods. Omslag og navne: {0}/covers, når Eden har læst et spil."

#. {0} is the app's data folder: /data/ps5cemu, or the PS5CEMU-HAR-data folder on the drive the app is installed on
#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:2085
msgid "Saves: {0}/melonds/saves (a .sav next to the game is used the first time). Save states: melonds/states. Cheats: melonds/cheats/<game file>.mch. Slot-2 GBA games: melonds/slot2/<game file>.gba. DSi games and DS wireless are not supported."
msgstr "Gemte data: {0}/melonds/saves (en .sav ved siden af spillet bruges første gang). Gemte tilstande: melonds/states. Snydekoder: melonds/cheats/<spilfil>.mch, i melonDS' format. Et GBA-spil til stik 2: melonds/slot2/<spilfil>.gba. DSi-spil og DS'ens trådløse funktion understøttes ikke."

